1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Create “Patio” in manual mode.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Example: a rectangle measuring 4 × 3 m. Directions and lengths are entered manually.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:18,500
Save P1 and set the first direction to 0°.

4
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:27,000
Enter 4 m, review the side and save P2. Follow the same three steps for each side.

5
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:36,500
Enter a 90° turn to the left.

6
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:46,000
Add 3 m and 3.8 m, saving each point. After the third side, choose Leave open.

7
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:52,000
Choose Edit last side in the summary.

8
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:58,000
Change 3.8 m to 4 m and save changes. The correction updates the saved sketch.

9
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:03,000
Continue → Finish → Close outline.

10
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:08,000
The side to P1 is calculated, not measured. Perimeter 14 m · area 12 m².

11
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:14,000
Choose Export PNG → Share PNG.

12
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:20,000
Free keeps the outlineGo watermark. The file is created; no recipient is selected.
